    "detailed_description": "<strong>Step into the future with our groundbreaking VR game set in the year 2119, where humanity embarks on a historic journey into space. Witness the turning point in space exploration history as nations rush to colonize the uncharted territories of our solar system. Join the &quot;CCM-1&quot; (Callisto Colonization Mission) expedition, aimed at the enigmatic moon of Jupiter - Callisto.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR EXPERIENCE:</h2>Immerse yourself in the wonders of virtual reality as you become a part of the Callisto Colonization Mission. Feel the vastness of space, experience the thrill of interplanetary travel, and explore the mysteries of a distant moon, all in stunning VR. Every detail comes to life, providing you with an unparalleled sense of presence and immersion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2>In this VR experience, you're not just a spectator; you're an active participant in the mission. Engage in challenging puzzles that require your wit and problem-solving skills. Unravel the gripping storyline that unfolds around you, and pay attention to every detail as it might hold the key to your next move. Delve deep into the intricacies of the game mechanics, enabling you to progress further in your cosmic journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Redirect Lasers:</h2> Manipulate powerful lasers to overcome obstacles and unlock new paths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.poster.avif?t=1748878578\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.webm?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.mp4?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Properties of Fields:</h2> Alter the properties of fields to your advantage, shaping the environment to suit your needs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4a99e6b0ad07f83bccb25e9d8f5c9ba7.poster.avif?t=1748878578\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4a99e6b0ad07f83bccb25e9d8f5c9ba7.webm?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4a99e6b0ad07f83bccb25e9d8f5c9ba7.mp4?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activate the Switches:</h2> Interact with various switches and mechanisms, crucial for advancing through the mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/52b3da7aa31d67d0655d3b468288341d.poster.avif?t=1748878578\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/52b3da7aa31d67d0655d3b468288341d.webm?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/52b3da7aa31d67d0655d3b468288341d.mp4?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Information is Your Ally:</h2> Use the provided information wisely; it's your guide in this vast, unknown space.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/1defb7706766e91f1ef62cef8e8c6b11.poster.avif?t=1748878578\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/1defb7706766e91f1ef62cef8e8c6b11.webm?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/1defb7706766e91f1ef62cef8e8c6b11.mp4?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>\u2022\tChallenging Puzzles: Exercise your brain with puzzles that test your logical thinking and creativity.<br>\u2022\tDiscover Story Notes: Uncover hidden story notes that enrich the narrative, providing depth to your adventure.<br>\u2022\tBeautiful Music: Immerse yourself in a captivating musical score that enhances the atmosphere and emotions of your journey.<br>\u2022\tMaster Game Mechanics: Explore and understand the subtleties of the game mechanics, empowering you to overcome challenges and progress in the mission.<br>\u2022\tPrepare yourself for an unparalleled VR experience, where the future of humanity and the mysteries of space come alive around you. Are you ready to step into the unknown?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Step into the future with our groundbreaking VR game set in the year 2119, where humanity embarks on a historic journey into space. Witness the turning point in space exploration history as nations rush to colonize the uncharted territories of our solar system. Join the &quot;CCM-1&quot; (Callisto Colonization Mission) expedition, aimed at the enigmatic moon of Jupiter - Callisto.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR EXPERIENCE:</h2>Immerse yourself in the wonders of virtual reality as you become a part of the Callisto Colonization Mission. Feel the vastness of space, experience the thrill of interplanetary travel, and explore the mysteries of a distant moon, all in stunning VR. Every detail comes to life, providing you with an unparalleled sense of presence and immersion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2>In this VR experience, you're not just a spectator; you're an active participant in the mission. Engage in challenging puzzles that require your wit and problem-solving skills. Unravel the gripping storyline that unfolds around you, and pay attention to every detail as it might hold the key to your next move. Delve deep into the intricacies of the game mechanics, enabling you to progress further in your cosmic journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Redirect Lasers:</h2> Manipulate powerful lasers to overcome obstacles and unlock new paths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.poster.avif?t=1748878578\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.webm?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696780/extras/4d56a75c61e12bf42fe4451b4130cfac.mp4?t=1748878578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></